# Vercel only needs the rendered site and the config that points at it.
#
# Every pattern here is ANCHORED with a leading slash. Without one, gitignore
# semantics match at any depth -- so a bare `data/` also excluded `docs/data/`,
# which is the published record itself, and the site deployed with its own
# evidence stripped out. Anchor these or they reach further than they look.
/bese/
/data/
/tests/
/*.py
/*.md
/.gitignore
/overrides.json
__pycache__/
